{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"We need to manipulate the equation to get $   d    $ by itself.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align} 2d+4\u0026=10+5d \\\\\\\\\n2d+4 \\blueD{-5d} \u0026= 10+5d\\blueD{-5d} \u0026\u0026\\small\\gray{\\text{Subtract $5d$ from each side.}}\\\\\\\\\n-3d+4\u0026=10 \u0026\u0026\\small\\gray{\\text{Combine like terms.}}\\\\\\\\\n-3d+4\\blueD{-4} \u0026= 10\\blueD{-4} \u0026\u0026\\small\\gray{\\text{Subtract $4$ from each side.}}\\\\\\\\\n-3d \u0026=6 \u0026\u0026\\small\\gray{\\text{Combine like terms.}}\\\\\\\\\n\\dfrac{-3d}{\\blueD{-3}} \u0026= \\dfrac{6}{\\blueD{-3}} \u0026\u0026\\small\\gray{\\text{Divide each side by $-3$.}}\\\\\\\\\nd \u0026= \\greenD{-2} \u0026\u0026\\small\\gray{\\text{Simplify.}}\\\\\\\\\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"**The answer:**\n\n\u003e$d = \\greenD{  -2     }~~~~~~~~$ [[☃ explanation 1]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"explanation 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"explanation":"$\\begin{align} 2d+4\u0026=10+5d \\\\\\\\\n2(\\greenD{   -2  })+4 \u0026\\stackrel?= 10+5(\\greenD{  -2  }) \\\\\\\\\n-4 + 4 \u0026\\stackrel?= 10+(-10) \\\\\\\\\n0\u0026= 0 ~~~~~~~\\text{Yes!}\n\\end{align}$","hidePrompt":"Okay, got it","showPrompt":"Let's check our work!","static":false,"widgets":{}},"static":false,"type":"explanation","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Solve for $d$.**\n\n$2d+4=10+5d$\n\n$d=$ [[☃ numeric-input 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"numeric-input 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answers":[{"maxError":null,"message":"","simplify":"optional","status":"correct","strict":false,"value":-2}],"coefficient":false,"labelText":"","multipleNumberInput":false,"rightAlign":false,"size":"normal","static":false},"static":false,"type":"numeric-input